//RS //! Deterministic terminal projection for the shared `jet.devtools.v1` stream.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module owns terminal facts only: bounded nodes, viewport/capability
//RS //! state, keyboard routing, and frame diffs.  It deliberately does not know
//RS //! what a Build, Query, Job, or any other domain panel means.  Session and
//RS //! protocol adapters convert their canonical event into [`TerminalHostEvent`]
//RS //! before calling [`TerminalHost::sync_projection`] or [`TerminalHost::sync_session`].
//RS 
